{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "jdmg-checkout-api-collection",
    "name": "JDMG Checkout API",
    "description": "Colección del checkout JDMG.\n\n## Cómo importar\n1. Abre Postman\n2. Import → Upload Files\n3. Selecciona este JSON\n4. Elige el environment Local o Production\n\n## Flujo sugerido\n1. GET Products (guarda productId)\n2. Completa cardToken / acceptanceToken / acceptPersonalAuth en el environment\n3. POST Create Transaction\n4. GET Transaction by ID\n\nLos tokens de sandbox se obtienen desde el front (Network) o tokenizando con la llave pública.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/",
            "description": "Health check del backend NestJS."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Products",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Products",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const products = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (Array.isArray(products) && products.length > 0) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('productId', products[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
            "description": "Lista productos. Guarda el primer `id` en `productId`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Transactions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Create Transaction",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.id) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('transactionId', body.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"name\": \"Juan Perez\",\n    \"email\": \"juan@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"3001234567\"\n  },\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"address\": \"Calle 123 #45-67\",\n    \"city\": \"Bogota\",\n    \"fee\": 5000\n  },\n  \"cardToken\": \"{{cardToken}}\",\n  \"acceptanceToken\": \"{{acceptanceToken}}\",\n  \"acceptPersonalAuth\": \"{{acceptPersonalAuth}}\",\n  \"installments\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions",
            "description": "Crea y procesa el pago.\n\nVariables requeridas en el environment:\n- productId\n- cardToken\n- acceptanceToken\n- acceptPersonalAuth\n\ninstallments opcionales: 1 | 3 | 6 | 12"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Transaction by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}",
            "description": "Consulta una transacción por id. Usa `transactionId` del POST anterior."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://d331q1et3v146i.cloudfront.net"
    }
  ]
}
